{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SNZYBtHAkyHRjFFpv45dAS","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Host interface\n2\t\n3\tThe host loads the configured factory, keeps one returned registry for its\n4\tlifetime, and calls call(tool, token, arguments, request_id). Arguments are JSON-\n5\tcompatible values. Every call supplies its own credential, even when a host\n6\tretains a session. The credential table is immutable for a local instance except\n7\tfor disabled IDs. Credential scopes bound each token's delegation, including\n8\twhen two credentials identify the same subject.\n9\t\n10\tThe registry is an in-process MCP-shaped tool component. No MCP wire transport,\n11\tSDK, proxy, browser, network listener or external policy service is supplied.\n12\tThe host must not replace the original caller credential with a service token.\n13\tTyped errors cross this interface; their network representation is not supplied.\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5cea9752-2b3a-4e64-83b5-321ecd75e788","uuid":"1288f935-852d-41a3-bea3-72dd58aa2f93","timestamp":"2026-10-26T05:24:11.629Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-1mchwn3g/repo/docs/host.md","content":"# Host interface\n\nThe host loads the configured factory, keeps one returned registry for its\nlifetime, and calls call(tool, token, arguments, request_id). Arguments are JSON-\ncompatible values. Every call supplies its own credential, even when a host\nretains a session. The credential table is immutable for a local instance except\nfor disabled IDs. Credential scopes bound each token's delegation, including\nwhen two credentials identify the same subject.\n\nThe registry is an in-process MCP-shaped tool component. No MCP wire transport,\nSDK, proxy, browser, network listener or external policy service is supplied.\nThe host must not replace the original caller credential with a service token.\nTyped errors cross this interface; their network representation is not supplied.\n","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SNZYBtHAkyHRjFFpv45dAS","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
