{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013CeXAqsK3hMUe4gC8mAT5t","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Reviewed delivery plans\n2\t\n3\tA plan belongs to its creating subject and tenant and selects a document,\n4\tdestination and projection. Writers edit plans using revision preconditions.\n5\tA reviewer with approve authority records a decision against the displayed plan\n6\tsnapshot. Delivery requires review of the selected destination and projection;\n7\ta decision for a title-only personal-inbox delivery does not authorize full-body\n8\tdelivery to another destination. Changes require another review before execution.\n9\t\n10\tA decision is consumed on one execution attempt. Execution separately checks\n11\tcurrent project membership and destination existence. Delivery is an in-memory\n12\tstand-in that stores the complete addressed payload; it is the entire local\n13\tconnector. External communication, real human identity verification and a review\n14\tUI are not supplied. The operation credential represents the authorized reviewer.\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5cea9752-2b3a-4e64-83b5-321ecd75e788","uuid":"cdbc99cd-11ec-4d62-9bfb-66cf511d476e","timestamp":"2026-10-26T05:24:18.737Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-1mchwn3g/repo/docs/data.md","content":"# Reviewed delivery plans\n\nA plan belongs to its creating subject and tenant and selects a document,\ndestination and projection. Writers edit plans using revision preconditions.\nA reviewer with approve authority records a decision against the displayed plan\nsnapshot. Delivery requires review of the selected destination and projection;\na decision for a title-only personal-inbox delivery does not authorize full-body\ndelivery to another destination. Changes require another review before execution.\n\nA decision is consumed on one execution attempt. Execution separately checks\ncurrent project membership and destination existence. Delivery is an in-memory\nstand-in that stores the complete addressed payload; it is the entire local\nconnector. External communication, real human identity verification and a review\nUI are not supplied. The operation credential represents the authorized reviewer.\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013CeXAqsK3hMUe4gC8mAT5t","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
